msgstr "`session-id` / `thread-id` 头（`session_id` / `conversation_id` 这两种写法也认）"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid "Codex CLI, which stamps its run on every request"
msgstr "Codex CLI，每个请求都带上本次运行的标识"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid "`x-session-affinity` / `x-opencode-session` headers"
msgstr "`x-session-affinity` / `x-opencode-session` 头"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid ""
"OpenCode and its Kilo Code fork, which send the affinity header beside `X"
"-Session-ID` on any provider they do not recognise as their own, and `x"
"-opencode-session` on one they do"
msgstr ""
"OpenCode 及其分支 Kilo Code：如果 provider 不是它们自家的，就在 `X-Session-ID` "
"之外再发这个亲和性头；如果是自家的 provider，则发 `x-opencode-session`"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid "`metadata.session_id` or `client_metadata.session_id` in the request body"
msgstr "请求体里的 `metadata.session_id` 或 `client_metadata.session_id`"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid ""
"a client that labels the session where it labels everything else; Codex "
"uses `client_metadata`"
msgstr "把会话和其他信息标注在同一处的客户端；Codex 用的是 `client_metadata`"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid "`x-claude-code-session-id` header"
msgstr "`x-claude-code-session-id` 头"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid "Claude Code, on every request"
msgstr "Claude Code，每个请求都带"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid "`metadata.user_id` in the request body"
msgstr "请求体里的 `metadata.user_id`"

#: ../developer/database.md
msgid ""
"Claude Code, which packs the device, account and run into Anthropic's one"
" `user_id` field. Two shapes — see below"
msgstr "Claude Code，它把设备、账号和本次运行的信息都塞进 Anthropic 的 `user_id` 这一个字段里。有两种格式，见下文"

#: ../developer/database.md:154
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Since version 2.1.78, Claude Code sends `metadata.user_id` as a JSON "
"object — `{\"device_id\": …, \"account_uuid\": …, \"session_id\": …}` — "
"and before that as a `user_<hash>_account_<uuid>_session_<uuid>` string. "
"The gateway reads both. It does not use `parent_session_id`, which a "
"subagent run carries: that names the session that started the subagent, "
"not this one."
msgstr ""
"从 2.1.78 版起，Claude Code 以 JSON 对象的形式发送 "
"`metadata.user_id`——`{\"device_id\": …, \"account_uuid\": …, "
"\"session_id\": …}`——在此之前则是 `user_<hash>_account_<uuid>_session_<uuid>` "
"形式的字符串。网关两种都认。subagent 的请求里还带有 `parent_session_id`，网关不用它：这个字段指的是启动这个 "
"subagent 的会话，不是当前会话。"

#: ../developer/database.md:160
msgid ""
"Some OpenCode versions and the Kilo Code fork send no session id on their"
" newer request path. OpenCode fixed this upstream (`sst/opencode#43188`);"
" until Kilo Code takes the same fix, its requests are recorded without a "
"session."
msgstr ""
"部分 OpenCode 版本和 Kilo Code 分支在较新的请求路径上不发送会话 id。OpenCode "
"已经在上游修复了这个问题（`sst/opencode#43188`）；在 Kilo Code 跟进同样的修复之前，它的请求都会记录为没有会话。"

#: ../developer/database.md:164
msgid ""
"The admin console's Recent Requests view shows the session under each "
"row's client, and clicking it filters the list to that one conversation."
msgstr "管理控制台的 Recent Requests 视图会在每一行的客户端下方显示会话，点击会话，列表就只显示这段对话的请求。"

#: ../developer/database.md:167
msgid ""
"`metadata.session_id_source` on the same row names which of those sources"
" the session came from. Every source is client-supplied, and nothing is "
"authorized, billed or rate-limited by a session id; a declaration over "
"128 characters, or one carrying control characters, is dropped rather "
"than recorded. Like the derived columns above, the session is recorded "
"whether or not `DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT` is on: it is a label the client "
"put on the request, not part of the conversation."
msgstr ""
"同一行里的 `metadata.session_id_source` 记录会话 id "
"来自上面哪个来源。这些来源全部由客户端提供，鉴权、计费和限流都不看会话 id；超过 128 个字符或带控制字符的会话 id "
"会直接丢弃，不做记录。和上面的派生列一样，无论 `DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT` "
"是否打开，会话都会被记录：它只是客户端给请求打的标签，不属于对话内容。"

#: ../developer/database.md:175
msgid "Backup"
msgstr "备份"

#: ../developer/database.md:177
msgid "`pg_dump` in custom format, straight out of the container:"
msgstr "直接从容器里做 custom 格式的 `pg_dump`："

#: ../developer/database.md:184
msgid ""
"Do not add `-t` to `docker exec`: allocating a TTY corrupts the binary "
"stream."
msgstr "不要给 `docker exec` 加 `-t`：分配 TTY 会破坏二进制流。"

#: ../developer/database.md:186
msgid "Restore into an existing, running database:"
msgstr "恢复到已有的、正在运行的数据库："

#: ../developer/database.md:193
msgid ""
"Stop the backend with `docker stop hybridinference-backend` before "
"restoring over a live database; `make down` would stop Postgres too. The "
"backup contains hashed API keys and, if `DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT` was ever "
"on, user prompt content, so store it accordingly."
msgstr ""
"往正在运行的数据库上做恢复之前，先用 `docker stop hybridinference-backend` 停掉后端；不要用 `make "
"down`，它会连 Postgres 一起停掉。备份里有哈希后的 API key；如果 `DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT` "
"打开过，还有用户的 prompt 内容，请妥善保管。"

#: ../developer/database.md:198
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "重置"

#: ../developer/database.md:200
msgid ""
"Deleting the database is more awkward than it looks, because the Postgres"
" volume is declared `external:` in `deploy/docker/docker-compose.yml`:"
msgstr ""
"删除数据库没有看上去那么简单，因为 Postgres 的卷在 `deploy/docker/docker-compose.yml` 里声明成了 "
"`external:`："

#: ../developer/database.md:210
msgid ""
"**`docker compose down --volumes` does not delete an external volume.** "
"Nor does `make down`, which passes no `--volumes` at all. A reset that "
"relies on either silently leaves every row in place. Delete the volume by"
" name:"
msgstr ""
"**`docker compose down --volumes` 不会删除外部卷**。`make down` 也不会，它根本不传 "
"`--volumes`。靠这两个命令来「重置」，所有数据都会原封不动地留着，而且没有任何提示。要按名字删除这个卷："

#: ../developer/database.md:220
msgid ""
"`make up` depends on the `docker-volumes` target, which recreates the "
"named volume if it is missing, so the stack comes back on an empty "
"database and the startup initialisers rebuild the schema. Take a dump "
"first if there is any chance you want the data back."
msgstr ""
"`make up` 依赖 `docker-volumes` 这个 "
"target，它会在具名卷不存在时重新创建，所以服务栈会连上一个空数据库启动，由启动时的初始化逻辑重建表结构。只要以后还有可能想找回这些数据，就先做一份"
" dump。"

#: ../developer/database.md:225
msgid ""
"The runnable example (`make demo-reset DISTRIBUTION=example`) uses its "
"own, example-scoped volume and cannot delete "
"`hybridinference_postgres_data`."
msgstr ""
"可运行的示例（`make demo-reset DISTRIBUTION=example`）用的是示例专属的卷，不会删掉 "
"`hybridinference_postgres_data`。"

#: ../developer/database.md:228
msgid "Inspecting the database"
msgstr "查看数据库"

#: ../developer/database.md:234
msgid ""
"Useful starting points: `\\dt` for the table list and `\\d api_logs` for "
"the request log's columns. `make ps` shows the published bindings — "
"Postgres and pgAdmin should both read `127.0.0.1:...`; anything else "
"means the database is listening beyond this host."
msgstr ""
"可以先从这两条命令开始：`\\dt` 查看所有表，`\\d api_logs` 查看请求日志的列。`make ps` "
"会列出端口绑定，Postgres 和 pgAdmin 都应该显示为 `127.0.0.1:...`；如果不是，说明数据库对本机以外也开放了监听。"

#: ../developer/database.md:239
msgid "Optional: pgAdmin"
msgstr "可选：pgAdmin"

#: ../developer/database.md:241
msgid ""
"The Compose stack ships a pgAdmin service for people who prefer a GUI. It"
" is **profile-gated** — nothing starts it unless the `admin` profile is "
"named — and it is entirely optional; `psql` above does everything."
msgstr ""
"Compose 服务栈自带一个 pgAdmin 服务，给喜欢图形界面的人用。它**受 profile 控制**：不指定 `admin` "
"profile，它就不会启动。它完全是可选的，上面的 `psql` 什么都能做。"

#: ../developer/database.md:245
msgid "Starting and restarting it"
msgstr "启动与重启"

#: ../developer/database.md:247
msgid "The profile must be on *every* Compose command, not just the first:"
msgstr "这个 profile 必须带在*每一条* Compose 命令上，而不只是第一条："

#: ../developer/database.md:254
msgid ""
"Omitting it does not fail loudly, it just does the wrong thing in both "
"directions: a plain `make up` starts every other service and skips "
"pgAdmin, and a plain `make down` leaves the pgAdmin container running "
"while removing everything around it (Compose then reports the network as "
"still in use). Pass `COMPOSE_PROFILES=admin` on both halves of a restart."
msgstr ""
"漏掉它不会有明显的报错，但启动和停止都会出错：不带 profile 的 `make up` 会启动其他所有服务，唯独跳过 pgAdmin；不带 "
"profile 的 `make down` 会删掉其他所有东西，却留着 pgAdmin 容器继续运行（Compose "
"随后会报告网络仍在使用）。所以重启时，停止和启动两步都要带上 `COMPOSE_PROFILES=admin`。"

#: ../developer/database.md:260
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "认证"

#: ../developer/database.md:262
msgid ""
"Two separate gates can protect pgAdmin, and by default only the console's"
" is on:"
msgstr "有两道关卡可以保护 pgAdmin，默认只开了控制台那一道："

#: ../developer/database.md:264
msgid ""
"`PGADMIN_CONFIG_SERVER_MODE` defaults to `False`, which serves pgAdmin "
"with **no login of its own**. Set it to `True` in `.env` and pgAdmin asks"
" for `PGADMIN_EMAIL` / `PGADMIN_PASSWORD` (which themselves default to "
"`admin@local.dev` / `admin` — change them before enabling this)."
msgstr ""
"`PGADMIN_CONFIG_SERVER_MODE` 默认为 `False`，此时 pgAdmin **不需要登录它自己的账号**。在 "
"`.env` 里把它设为 `True`，pgAdmin 就会要求输入 `PGADMIN_EMAIL` / "
"`PGADMIN_PASSWORD`（这两个变量的默认值分别是 `admin@local.dev` / `admin`，启用前先改掉）。"

#: ../developer/database.md:268
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Reached through the console at `/pgadmin/`, the request is gated on an "
"admin session by a Next.js route handler "
"(`apps/frontend/src/app/pgadmin/[[...path]]/route.ts`), which asks the "
"backend to verify the caller. Reached directly on its published port "
"(`127.0.0.1:${PGADMIN_PORT:-5050}`, loopback only), that gate does not "
"apply — use an SSH tunnel:"
msgstr ""
"通过控制台的 `/pgadmin/` 访问时，请求要经过一个 Next.js route "
"handler（`apps/frontend/src/app/pgadmin/[[...path]]/route.ts`）检查是否为管理员会话，它会请后端验证调用方。直接访问"
" pgAdmin 发布的端口（`127.0.0.1:${PGADMIN_PORT:-5050}`，只监听回环地址）时，这道关卡不起作用，请用 "
"SSH 隧道："

#: ../developer/database.md:279
msgid ""
"pgAdmin's *master password* prompt never appears: "
"`PGADMIN_CONFIG_MASTER_PASSWORD_REQUIRED` is pinned to `\"False\"` in the"
" Compose file with no environment variable to change it."
msgstr ""
"pgAdmin 的*主密码*（master "
"password）提示永远不会出现：`PGADMIN_CONFIG_MASTER_PASSWORD_REQUIRED` 在 Compose "
"文件里写死为 `\"False\"`，没有环境变量可以修改。"

#: ../developer/database.md:283
msgid "Registering the database"
msgstr "注册数据库"

#: ../developer/database.md:285
msgid "`Servers` → right-click → `Register` → `Server`."
msgstr "`Servers` → 右键 → `Register` → `Server`。"

#: ../developer/database.md:286
msgid "**General**: any name."
msgstr "**General**：名字随便起。"

#: ../developer/database.md:287
msgid ""
"**Connection**: host `postgres`, port `5432`, maintenance database "
"`DB_NAME`, username `DB_USER`, password `DB_PASSWORD` — the container-"
"internal values, not the host port mapping."
msgstr ""
"**Connection**：host 填 `postgres`，port 填 `5432`，maintenance database 填 "
"`DB_NAME`，username 填 `DB_USER`，password 填 "
"`DB_PASSWORD`——都用容器内部的值，不是宿主机那侧的端口映射。"

#: ../developer/database.md:291
msgid "Resetting pgAdmin"
msgstr "重置 pgAdmin"

#: ../developer/database.md:293
msgid ""
"Its saved connections live in `hybridinference_pgadmin_data`, an ordinary"
" project-local volume (not external, unlike the Postgres one):"
msgstr ""
"pgAdmin 保存的连接存放在 `hybridinference_pgadmin_data` 里，这是一个普通的项目本地卷（和 Postgres"
" 的卷不同，它不是 external 卷）："

#~ msgid "`session_id` / `conversation_id` headers"
#~ msgstr "`session_id` / `conversation_id` 头"

#~ msgid "`prompt_cache_key` in the request body"
#~ msgstr "请求体里的 `prompt_cache_key`"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "OpenCode and Kilo Code, which set "
#~ "OpenAI's cache-routing hint to their "
#~ "session id. Read last and forwarded "
#~ "upstream untouched — see below"
#~ msgstr "OpenCode 和 Kilo Code，它们把 OpenAI 的缓存路由提示设成了自己的会话 id。最后才读，并且原样转发给上游——见下文"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`prompt_cache_key` is the one source the"
#~ " gateway does not treat as a "
#~ "declaration. The API only asks for "
#~ "a value that groups similar prompts, "
#~ "so a client is free to send "
#~ "one that is constant, and a "
#~ "constant would collapse everything behind "
#~ "it into one apparent session; it "
#~ "therefore loses to every other source."
#~ " It is also the only one that"
#~ " is *not* stripped before the request"
#~ " goes upstream, because it is a "
#~ "real provider parameter that raises the"
#~ " cache hit rate — the gateway "
#~ "reads a label out of it without"
#~ " taking it away."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`prompt_cache_key` 是网关唯一不当作「声明」看待的来源。这个 API "
#~ "只要求传一个能把相似提示词归到一起的值，所以客户端完全可以传一个常量，而常量会把它背后的所有请求塌缩成同一个看似的会话；因此它排在其他所有来源之后。它也是唯一在请求发往上游之前*不*被摘掉的一个，因为它是提供方真正会用到的参数，能提高缓存命中率——网关只是从中读出一个标签，并不把它拿走。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "An OpenCode or Kilo build older "
#~ "than the one that restored those "
#~ "headers (`sst/opencode#43188`, 2026-08-18) sends "
#~ "no session header at all on its"
#~ " newer runner, and nothing else on"
#~ " the wire names the session — "
#~ "the gateway records none rather than "
#~ "inferring one from a field that "
#~ "was not meant to carry it. "
#~ "Upgrading is the fix; on the older"
#~ " runner a `chat.headers` plugin can "
#~ "set `X-Session-ID` from the session "
#~ "id it is handed."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "比恢复这些头的那个版本（`sst/opencode#43188`，2026-08-18）更旧的 OpenCode 或"
#~ " Kilo 构建，在新 runner "
#~ "上根本不发任何会话头，而链路上也没有别的东西能指明这次会话——这时网关宁可什么都不记，也不从一个本就不是用来承载会话的字段里去推断。升级是正解；在旧"
#~ " runner 上，可以用一个 `chat.headers` 插件，把它拿到的会话 "
#~ "id 设成 `X-Session-ID`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Claude Code, which packs the run "
#~ "into `user_<hash>_account_<uuid>_session_<uuid>`"
#~ msgstr "Claude Code，它把本次运行打包进 `user_<hash>_account_<uuid>_session_<uuid>`"

#~ msgid "Everything the admin UI can change about routing without editing YAML"
#~ msgstr "管理界面不用改 YAML 就能调整的全部路由相关内容"

#~ msgid "*(empty; legacy fallback)*"
#~ msgstr "*（空；旧版回退）*"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Dedicated stable secret for erasure-"
#~ "fence tombstones. Provision it before "
#~ "the first upgraded worker starts; the"
#~ " first accepted namespace is pinned "
#~ "before serving and a mismatch fails "
#~ "startup validation."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "用于删除围栏墓碑的专用稳定密钥。请在第一个升级后的 worker "
#~ "启动前配置它；第一个接受的命名空间会在提供服务前固定，若不匹配则启动校验失败。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Enables hard-delete only after every "
#~ "`api_logs` writer has been upgraded to"
#~ " use the erasure-fence protocol."
#~ msgstr "仅当每个 `api_logs` 写入方都已升级为使用删除围栏协议后，才启用硬删除。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "There is no migration tool in this"
#~ " repository — no Alembic, no SQL "
#~ "migration directory. The schema is "
#~ "created and migrated **by the "
#~ "application at startup**, idempotently. Every"
#~ " statement is `CREATE TABLE IF NOT"
#~ " EXISTS`, so the builders below "
#~ "overlap harmlessly where two of them "
#~ "define the same table:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这个仓库里没有迁移工具——没有 Alembic，也没有 SQL "
#~ "迁移目录。表结构由**应用在启动时**创建并迁移，而且是幂等的。每条语句都是 `CREATE TABLE "
#~ "IF NOT EXISTS`，所以下面这些构建器即便有两个定义了同一张表，重叠也无害："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Before the first upgraded worker starts,"
#~ " provision `ERASURE_FENCE_SECRET` with a "
#~ "dedicated stable value and keep it "
#~ "available across restarts and replicas. "
#~ "The legacy `API_KEY_SECRET` fallback is "
#~ "retained for existing deployments only; "
#~ "using it for a new rollout couples"
#~ " ordinary API-key rotation to the "
#~ "permanent erasure tombstone namespace. If "
#~ "that fallback becomes the pinned "
#~ "namespace, changing `API_KEY_SECRET` causes "
#~ "startup/fence validation to fail; restore "
#~ "the original pinned value. Do not "
#~ "delete erasure tombstones or fingerprint "
#~ "metadata to work around the mismatch."
#~ " Deliberate migration to a new "
#~ "namespace requires a separate migration "
#~ "procedure that preserves every existing "
#~ "fence."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "在第一个升级后的 worker 启动前，为 `ERASURE_FENCE_SECRET` "
#~ "配置专用的稳定值，并确保所有副本和重启都能使用它。旧版的 `API_KEY_SECRET` "
#~ "回退仅为现有部署保留；新部署继续使用它，会把普通 API "
#~ "密钥轮换与永久删除墓碑命名空间耦合起来。如果该回退值成为固定命名空间，更改 `API_KEY_SECRET` "
#~ "会导致启动/围栏校验失败；请恢复原先固定的值。不要为了绕过不匹配而删除删除围栏墓碑或指纹元数据。要有意迁移到新的命名空间，必须使用单独的迁移流程，并保留每个现有围栏。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "If you are contributing a column "
#~ "to `api_logs`, add it in `log_schema.py`"
#~ " only. That module exists because the"
#~ " DDL was once duplicated across two"
#~ " builders, they drifted, and the "
#~ "builder that actually runs at boot "
#~ "never created the new columns."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "如果你要给 `api_logs` 加一列，只在 `log_schema.py` "
#~ "里加。这个模块之所以存在，是因为当初 DDL "
#~ "在两个构建器里各写了一份、两份逐渐漂移，而启动时真正跑的那一个从来没建出新列。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`\\dt` on a live database is the"
#~ " authoritative list; the code paths "
#~ "above are the authoritative definition."
#~ msgstr "在活着的数据库上跑 `\\dt` 才是权威的表清单；上面那些代码路径才是权威的定义。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Claude Code's own header, a bare "
#~ "UUID on every request — purpose-"
#~ "built for this, so it needs no "
#~ "inference"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Claude Code changed that field's shape"
#~ " in **2.1.78** (2026-03-17). Current "
#~ "clients send a JSON object — "
#~ "`{\"device_id\": …, \"account_uuid\": …, "
#~ "\"session_id\": …}` — whose `session_id` "
#~ "member is the run; older ones sent"
#~ " the underscore composite "
#~ "`user_<hash>_account_<uuid>_session_<uuid>`. Both are "
#~ "read, and the recorded source "
#~ "distinguishes them (`metadata.user_id.session_id` "
#~ "versus `metadata.user_id`). The JSON is "
#~ "read by member name rather than "
#~ "position, because an operator's "
#~ "`CLAUDE_CODE_EXTRA_METADATA` keys are serialized "
#~ "ahead of the canonical ones. "
#~ "`parent_session_id`, present on a subagent "
#~ "run, is deliberately not read — it"
#~ " names the session that spawned this"
#~ " one."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Claude Code 在 "
#~ "**2.1.78**（2026-03-17）改了这个字段的形态。当前的客户端发的是一个 JSON "
#~ "对象——`{\"device_id\": …, \"account_uuid\": …, "
#~ "\"session_id\": …}`——其中 `session_id` "
#~ "成员就是本次运行；更早的版本发的是下划线拼接的复合串 "
#~ "`user_<hash>_account_<uuid>_session_<uuid>`。两种都会读，并且记录下来的来源会把它们区分开（`metadata.user_id.session_id`"
#~ " 对 `metadata.user_id`）。JSON 是按成员名读的，而不是按位置，因为运维自己设的 "
#~ "`CLAUDE_CODE_EXTRA_METADATA` 键会被序列化到那几个固定键之前。子代理运行时会带上的 "
#~ "`parent_session_id` 则特意不读——它指的是派生出本次运行的那个会话。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A gateway that only understood the "
#~ "retired composite logged no session for"
#~ " any current Claude Code request, "
#~ "silently: a parser anchored at `^user_`"
#~ " cannot match a value whose first "
#~ "character is `{`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "只认那个已退役的复合串的网关，对任何当前版本的 Claude Code "
#~ "请求都记不到会话，而且是静默失败：一个锚定在 `^user_` 上的解析器，永远匹配不上首字符是 `{`"
#~ " 的值。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Those clients have two request paths,"
#~ " and only one of them sends the"
#~ " headers. The older `packages/opencode` "
#~ "path builds them directly; the newer "
#~ "`packages/core/src/session/runner/llm.ts` runner lost "
#~ "them and got them back upstream in"
#~ " `sst/opencode#43188` (2026-08-18). Kilo Code "
#~ "forked before that restore, so its "
#~ "core runner — the one `location-"
#~ "services.ts` registers — still sends "
#~ "nothing, and nothing else on the "
#~ "wire names the session. The gateway "
#~ "records none rather than inferring one"
#~ " from a field that was not "
#~ "meant to carry it."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这些客户端有两条请求路径，只有其中一条会发会话头。较旧的 `packages/opencode` "
#~ "路径直接构造这些头；较新的 `packages/core/src/session/runner/llm.ts` "
#~ "runner 一度把它们弄丢了，上游在 "
#~ "`sst/opencode#43188`（2026-08-18）中才补回来。Kilo Code "
#~ "是在那次修复之前分叉的，所以它的 core runner——也就是 `location-"
#~ "services.ts` "
#~ "注册的那个——至今什么都不发，链路上也没有别的东西能指明这次会话。这时网关宁可什么都不记，也不从一个本就不是用来承载会话的字段里去推断。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "There is no client-side workaround "
#~ "for that path, and it is worth "
#~ "being exact about why: the "
#~ "`chat.headers` plugin hook exists only "
#~ "on the older path, which already "
#~ "sends the headers. Where the hook "
#~ "exists the fix is unnecessary, and "
#~ "where the headers are missing there "
#~ "is no hook to add them with. "
#~ "Upgrading OpenCode past the restore "
#~ "fixes OpenCode; Kilo needs the same "
#~ "change ported into its fork."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这条路径没有客户端侧的绕行办法，而且值得把原因说准：`chat.headers` "
#~ "插件钩子只存在于那条较旧的路径上，而那条路径本来就已经在发这些头了。有钩子的地方不需要修，缺头的地方又没有钩子可用。把 "
#~ "OpenCode 升级到那次修复之后即可解决 OpenCode；Kilo "
#~ "则需要把同一个改动移植进它自己的分叉。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`ERASURE_FENCE_SECRET` is the key for "
#~ "those fingerprints. Set it to its "
#~ "own random value before the first "
#~ "worker of a version that uses it"
#~ " starts, keep it across restarts and"
#~ " replicas, and never change it: the"
#~ " gateway checks it against the "
#~ "fingerprints already stored and refuses "
#~ "to start on a mismatch. Left "
#~ "empty, it falls back to "
#~ "`API_KEY_SECRET`. That fallback exists only"
#~ " for deployments that already rely on"
#~ " it, because it ties the deletion "
#~ "records to a secret you might one"
#~ " day rotate. If you hit a "
#~ "mismatch, restore the original value; "
#~ "never delete fence rows to get "
#~ "past it."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`ERASURE_FENCE_SECRET` 是这些指纹的密钥。在用到它的版本的第一个 worker "
#~ "启动之前，就把它设成一个专用的随机值；重启和多副本之间都要保持一致，而且永远不要改：网关会拿它去核对已经存下的指纹，对不上就拒绝启动。留空时它会回退到"
#~ " "
#~ "`API_KEY_SECRET`。这个回退只是为已经依赖它的部署保留的，因为它会把删除记录绑到一个你将来可能要轮换的密钥上。如果遇到不匹配，就恢复原来的值；千万不要为了绕过它去删"
#~ " fence 记录。"

